{%- comment -%}
  mmw-product-carousel — UNIWERSALNA karuzela produktowa (Figma: BESTSELLERS, karta node 982:4042).
  Źródło: kolekcja + limit kart — jedna sekcja obsługuje bestsellery ×2, vouchery i produkty marki,
  bez osobnych wariantów.

  Mechanika WYŁĄCZNIE natywna Horizona (bez własnego JS):
    - <slideshow-component>/<slideshow-slides>/<slideshow-slide> — drag/scroll-snap (assets/slideshow.js)
    - snippet 'slideshow-controls' (style: 'dots') — strzałki na hover + kropki
    - snippet 'quick-add' — przycisk "Dodaj" zintegrowany z cart drawer (assets/quick-add.js)
  Renderujemy DWIE kopie karuzeli (desktop / mobile), przełączane klasami hidden--mobile /
  hidden--desktop — dokładnie ten sam wzorzec co natywny mobilny fallback w
  snippets/resource-list.liquid. Dzięki temu kropki liczą WIDOKI, nie pojedyncze produkty:
    - desktop: karty grupowane po `cards_per_view` w jeden <slideshow-slide> = jedna kropka na stronę
    - mobile: 1 karta = 1 <slideshow-slide> = 1 kropka (na mobile widok = pojedyncza karta)

  Customowa jest wyłącznie treść karty: obraz, badge (tagi bestseller/nowość lub cena promocyjna),
  tytuł, opis (metapole custom.opis_karty, fallback na opis produktu), cena, karta końcowa
  „Zobacz więcej”. Wszystko inne (scroll, strzałki, kropki, dodawanie do koszyka) to renderowanie
  natywnych snippetów Horizona.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign coll = section.settings.collection
  assign count = section.settings.products_count | default: 8
  assign per_view = section.settings.cards_per_view | default: 3
  assign show_end_card = section.settings.show_end_card
  assign desc_len = section.settings.description_length | default: 140
-%}
{%- if coll != blank and coll.products.size > 0 -%}
  {%- style -%}
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px;
      padding-block: 60px; padding-inline: var(--page-margin, 40px);
      background: var(--mmw-04);
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; color: var(--mmw-01); }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__title { margin: 0; font-family: var(--mmw-font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__desc { margin: 0; font-family: var(--mmw-font-text); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; max-width: 640px; }

    /* Strony/slajdy: desktop = grupa `cards_per_view` kart, mobile = 1 karta */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__page {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--mmw-pc-per-view, 3), 1fr);
      gap: 24px; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__slideshow--mobile .mmw-pc__card,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__slideshow--mobile .mmw-pc__end {
      max-width: 420px; margin-inline: auto;
    }

    /* Karta produktu */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__card {
      position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 331 / 507;
      border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--mmw-01);
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__media { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; display: block; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__img,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__img svg {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__card::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; border-radius: inherit; pointer-events: none;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%, rgba(0,0,0,.92) 100%);
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__badge {
      position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 24px; z-index: 2; background: var(--mmw-03); color: var(--mmw-01);
      font-family: var(--mmw-font-label); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 58px; line-height: 1.2;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__badge--sale { background: var(--mmw-02); }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__body {
      position: absolute; z-index: 2; left: 24px; right: 24px; bottom: 24px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__name {
      margin: 0; font-family: var(--mmw-font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1;
      color: var(--mmw-04); text-decoration: none;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__excerpt {
      margin: 0; font-family: var(--mmw-font-text); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--mmw-04);
      display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__price-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 4px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__price-block { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__price-line { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__price {
      font-family: var(--mmw-font-label); font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mmw-04);
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__price--sale { color: var(--mmw-02); }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__price-compare {
      font-family: var(--mmw-font-label); font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; color: var(--mmw-04);
      text-decoration: line-through; opacity: .85;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__price-note { margin: 0; font-family: var(--mmw-font-text); font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--mmw-04); opacity: .85; }

    /* Reskin natywnego quick-add: zawsze widoczny, okrągły, koralowy — jak w Figmie */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__quick-add { flex: 0 0 auto; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__quick-add .quick-add {
      position: static; inset: auto; pointer-events: auto;
      --quick-add-mobile-display: flex; --quick-add-mobile-opacity: 1; --quick-add-display: flex;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__quick-add .quick-add__button {
      position: static; opacity: 1 !important; height: 44px; width: 44px; border: none; border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(var(--mmw-02) 0 100%) padding-box; backdrop-filter: none;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__quick-add .quick-add__button .add-to-cart-text { background: transparent; border-radius: 50%; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__quick-add .quick-add__button .add-to-cart-icon { width: 20px; color: var(--mmw-04); }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__quick-add .quick-add__button .add-to-cart-text__content { display: none; }

    /* Karta końcowa „Zobacz więcej” */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__end {
      position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 331 / 507; border: 1px solid rgba(95,49,47,.25);
      border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      text-align: center; padding: 32px; text-decoration: none; background: var(--mmw-04);
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__end-img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: .18; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__end-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__end-heading { margin: 0; font-family: var(--mmw-font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--mmw-01); }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__end-btn {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mmw-01); color: var(--mmw-04);
      display: grid; place-items: center;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__end-btn svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; transform: rotate(90deg); }

    @media (max-width: 989px) {
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc { padding-block: 40px; gap: 24px; }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .mmw-pc__title { font-size: 36px; }
    }
  {%- endstyle -%}

  {%- comment -%} Karty produktów + opcjonalna karta końcowa, budowane raz i dzielone znacznikiem na tablicę (ten sam trik co list_items_array w sections/product-list.liquid) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture cards_concat -%}
    {%- assign item_index = 0 -%}
    {%- for product in coll.products limit: count -%}
      {%- if item_index > 0 -%}<!--@mmw-pc/split-->{%- endif -%}
      {%- assign item_index = item_index | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign on_sale = false
        assign badge_text = blank
        assign badge_class = 'mmw-pc__badge'
        if product.compare_at_price > product.price
          assign on_sale = true
          assign discount_pct = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price | round
          assign badge_text = '-' | append: discount_pct | append: '%'
          assign badge_class = badge_class | append: ' mmw-pc__badge--sale'
        elsif product.tags contains 'bestseller' or product.tags contains 'Bestseller'
          assign badge_text = 'Bestseller'
        elsif product.tags contains 'nowość' or product.tags contains 'nowosc' or product.tags contains 'Nowość'
          assign badge_text = 'Nowość'
        endif
        assign card_text = product.metafields.custom.opis_karty.value | default: product.description
        assign card_text = card_text | strip_html | truncate: desc_len
      -%}
      <div class="mmw-pc__card">
        <a class="mmw-pc__media" href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">
          {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
            <img class="mmw-pc__img" loading="lazy"
              src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 640 }}"
              srcset="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w, {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 640 }} 640w, {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w"
              sizes="(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 400px"
              width="640" height="980"
              alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}">
          {%- else -%}
            {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'mmw-pc__img' }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </a>
        {%- if badge_text != blank -%}<span class="{{ badge_class }}">{{ badge_text }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        <div class="mmw-pc__body">
          <a class="mmw-pc__name" href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a>
          {%- if card_text != blank -%}<p class="mmw-pc__excerpt">{{ card_text }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          <div class="mmw-pc__price-row">
            <div class="mmw-pc__price-block">
              {%- if on_sale -%}
                <div class="mmw-pc__price-line">
                  <span class="mmw-pc__price mmw-pc__price--sale">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                  <span class="mmw-pc__price-compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
                </div>
                <p class="mmw-pc__price-note">Ostatnia cena przed obniżką: {{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</p>
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="mmw-pc__price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            <div class="mmw-pc__quick-add">
              {%- render 'quick-add', product: product, section_id: section.id -%}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if show_end_card -%}
      {%- if item_index > 0 -%}<!--@mmw-pc/split-->{%- endif -%}
      <a class="mmw-pc__end" href="{{ section.settings.end_card_link | default: coll.url }}">
        {%- if section.settings.end_card_image != blank -%}
          <img class="mmw-pc__end-img" src="{{ section.settings.end_card_image | image_url: width: 640 }}" width="640" height="980" alt="" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="mmw-pc__end-content">
          <p class="mmw-pc__end-heading">{{ section.settings.end_card_heading | newline_to_br }}</p>
          <span class="mmw-pc__end-btn" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign cards_array = cards_concat | strip | split: '<!--@mmw-pc/split-->' -%}
  {%- assign total_items = cards_array.size -%}

  {%- comment -%} Desktop: grupuj karty po `per_view` w jeden slajd = jedna kropka na widok {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign page_count = total_items | divided_by: per_view -%}
  {%- assign page_remainder = total_items | modulo: per_view -%}
  {%- if page_remainder > 0 -%}{%- assign page_count = page_count | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture desktop_slides -%}
    {%- for i in (1..page_count) -%}
      {%- assign page_start = forloop.index0 | times: per_view -%}
      {%- assign page_items = cards_array | slice: page_start, per_view -%}
      <slideshow-slide
        ref="slides[]"
        aria-hidden="{% if forloop.first %}false{% else %}true{% endif %}"
        slide-id="mmw-pc-desktop-{{ forloop.index0 }}"
        media-fit="cover"
        style="--slideshow-timeline: --slide-{{ forloop.index0 }};"
      >
        <div class="mmw-pc__page">
          {%- for item in page_items -%}{{ item }}{%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </slideshow-slide>
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture desktop_controls -%}
    {%- render 'slideshow-controls', style: 'dots', item_count: page_count, show_arrows: true, icon_style: 'arrow', shape: 'circle', pagination_position: 'center' -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- comment -%} Mobile: 1 karta = 1 slajd = 1 kropka (widok pokazuje jedną kartę naraz) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture mobile_slides -%}
    {%- for item in cards_array -%}
      <slideshow-slide
        ref="slides[]"
        aria-hidden="{% if forloop.first %}false{% else %}true{% endif %}"
        slide-id="mmw-pc-mobile-{{ forloop.index0 }}"
        media-fit="cover"
        style="--slideshow-timeline: --slide-{{ forloop.index0 }};"
      >
        {{ item }}
      </slideshow-slide>
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture mobile_controls -%}
    {%- render 'slideshow-controls', style: 'dots', item_count: total_items, show_arrows: true, icon_style: 'arrow', shape: 'circle', pagination_position: 'center' -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  <section class="mmw-pc color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}">
    <div class="mmw-pc__head">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}<h2 class="mmw-pc__title">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.description != blank -%}<p class="mmw-pc__desc">{{ section.settings.description }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- assign desktop_style = '--mmw-pc-per-view: ' | append: per_view | append: ';' -%}
    <div class="hidden--mobile">
      {%- render 'slideshow',
        class: 'mmw-pc__slideshow mmw-pc__slideshow--desktop',
        slides: desktop_slides,
        slide_count: page_count,
        controls: desktop_controls,
        infinite: false,
        style: desktop_style
      -%}
    </div>
    <div class="hidden--desktop">
      {%- render 'slideshow',
        class: 'mmw-pc__slideshow mmw-pc__slideshow--mobile',
        slides: mobile_slides,
        slide_count: total_items,
        controls: mobile_controls,
        infinite: false
      -%}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "MMW Karuzela produktów",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Nagłówek", "default": "Poznaj nasze bestsellery" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "description", "label": "Opis", "default": "Smaki, aromaty i historie zamknięte w markach tworzonych w sercu Majątku Mała Wieś. Poznaj je wszystkie." },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Kolekcja produktów" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "products_count", "min": 2, "max": 16, "step": 1, "label": "Liczba kart", "default": 8 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cards_per_view", "min": 2, "max": 4, "step": 1, "label": "Kart na widok (desktop)", "default": 3, "info": "Na mobile zawsze 1 karta na widok." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "description_length", "min": 60, "max": 300, "step": 10, "unit": "zn.", "label": "Długość opisu karty", "default": 140 },
    { "type": "color_scheme", "id": "color_scheme", "label": "Schemat kolorów (strzałki, kropki, przycisk Dodaj)", "default": "scheme-1" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Badge karty ustawia się automatycznie: cena promocyjna produktu → rabat (np. „-10%”), tag „bestseller” → BESTSELLER, tag „nowość” → NOWOŚĆ. Opis karty: metapole custom.opis_karty, a bez niego — opis produktu (skrócony do długości powyżej)." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Karta końcowa „Zobacz więcej”" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_end_card", "label": "Pokaż kartę końcową", "default": true },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "end_card_heading", "label": "Tekst karty końcowej", "default": "Zobacz więcej\nbestsellerów" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "end_card_link", "label": "Link karty końcowej" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "end_card_image", "label": "Tło karty końcowej (opcjonalnie)" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "MMW Karuzela produktów" }]
}
{% endschema %}
